# NOTE ON OUTPUTS
# figures/*.png and results/*.{csv,json} are deliberately NOT ignored. They are the
# artefacts the manuscript reports, so the archived release must contain them: a reader
# should be able to verify every figure and number without re-running a simulation that
# takes hours. Regenerating them is still a one-command operation (see README).
#
# Raw case-study data is excluded: it is third-party monitoring data and is not ours to
# redistribute. See RELEASE.md, step 0.
